msgctxt "136"
msgid "Dang blast it... Where could it possibly be?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "148"
msgid "Still haven't figured it out?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "160"
msgid "Oh, you're back..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "172"
msgid ""
"Nobody seems to know what I'm talking about...\r\n"
"I'm at my wit's end trying to figure this out."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "184"
msgid ""
"Please... Will you help an old man find his lost fortune?\r\n"
"It's right here on this map, as I keep sayin'."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "196"
msgid "Sorry. Maybe some other time."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "208"
msgid ""
"Not like there'll be another time... *sigh* But why should yeh believe me? "
"A crazy old coot and his cockamamie war stories..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "220"
msgid "Never you mind. I'll find it myself somehow."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "280"
msgid ""
"Treasure hunting does sound like a nice diversion.\r\n"
"Okay, I'll help you find what you're looking for."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "292"
msgid ""
"Many thanks, young man. Once we find this treasure, I'll\r\n"
"make sure you get your share. I ain't the type to hog it.\r\n"
"Can't live this long being selfish."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "304"
msgid ""
"Well then, here's a copy of the map.\r\n"
"Let's split up and search."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "316"
msgid "You got an <Color:8>Old Map Copy<Color:Default>."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "340"
msgid ""
"Name's Tabayashi, by the way. I'll give you my cell phone\r\n"
"number, too. Give me a call if you find anything."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "352"
msgid ""
"Okay. I'm Kiryu, by the way. So all I have to do is follow\r\n"
"this map?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "364"
msgid ""
"Mhm. Make sure to call me when you find the treasure, too.\r\n"
"Don't go pullin' any fast ones!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "412"
msgid "I'll help you, old man."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "424"
msgid "Maybe some other time."
msgstr ""

